msgstr "Sulje"

msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to remove the selected document? This will also remove "
"its reading position and bookmarks."
msgstr ""
"Haluatko varmasti poistaa valitun asiakirjan? Myös lukukohta ja kirjanmerkit "
"poistetaan."

msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to remove the {} selected documents? This will also "
"remove their reading positions and bookmarks."
msgstr ""
"Haluatko varmasti poistaa {} valittua asiakirjaa? Myös lukukohdat ja "
"kirjanmerkit poistetaan."

#. TRANSLATORS: Title of the confirmation dialog
msgid "Confirm"
msgstr "Vahvista"

#. TRANSLATORS: Confirmation prompt when clearing all documents from the list.
msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to remove all documents from the list? This will also "
"remove all reading positions and bookmarks."
msgstr ""
"Haluatko varmasti poistaa luettelosta kaikki asiakirjat? Myös lukukohdat ja "
"kirjanmerkit poistetaan."

#. TRANSLATORS: Status bar text in the All Documents dialog when the list is empty
msgid "No documents."
msgstr "Asiakirjoja ei ole."

#. TRANSLATORS: Status bar text in the All Documents dialog showing the total number of documents in the list. The %d placeholder is replaced with the count. Plural form is chosen by that count.
msgid "%d document."
msgid_plural "%d documents."
msgstr[0] "%d asiakirja."
msgstr[1] "%d asiakirjaa."

